<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS4" title="In 6 Results and Discussion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.4 </span>RQ3: Consistency—Zero Data Corruption</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
