<section id="S6.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">6.2 </span>RQ1: Performance—Variable Outcomes</h3>

<div id="S6.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S6.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Parallel 13.1% slower overall with <span id="S6.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">significant task-to-task variation</span>: ranging from -21.1% speedup (Tic-Tac-Toe) to +39.4% slowdown (Algorithm Visualizer). Table <a href="#S6.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ 6.2 RQ1: Performance—Variable Outcomes ‣ 6 Results and Discussion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> shows per-task breakdown.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S6.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Per-task response time results</figcaption>
